{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch and collect <strong>Pondlings</strong> from ambient fishing vistas, with hundreds of exciting;<strong>\u00a0</strong>pattern, colour, and personality combinations to collect, name and care for. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collate and Decorate a <strong>Pondling-Tank</strong> that is truly <u>your own</u>! And share it with your friends on Steam! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Catch</u>\u00a0</strong>Pondlings in a variety of <i>Unique</i>, and <i>Ambient</i> Locations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639710/extras/08ab7fc95858ca804196bc9b1075bafa.poster.avif?t=1763147017\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639710/extras/08ab7fc95858ca804196bc9b1075bafa.webm?t=1763147017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Collect</u></strong> Pondlings of hundreds of possible colour and personality combinations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639710/extras/b01bae39e603b9be0bb69e17608545e7.poster.avif?t=1763147017\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639710/extras/b01bae39e603b9be0bb69e17608545e7.webm?t=1763147017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Decorate</u></strong> your tank with a <strong>huge</strong> variety of purchasable (<i>with in-game coins</i>)  and unlockable\u00a0<strong>backgrounds</strong>, <strong>flooring</strong> and <strong>decoration</strong> objects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639710/extras/0f3eaef4fe8820f9ff3dfbea3a18f4e3.poster.avif?t=1763147017\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639710/extras/0f3eaef4fe8820f9ff3dfbea3a18f4e3.webm?t=1763147017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Care-for</u></strong>\u00a0your Pondlings! By cleaning their tank, feeding, and interacting with them daily!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Unlock</u></strong>\u00a0new <strong>Pond-Passes</strong>, for access to exciting, and peculiar fishing locations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Share</u></strong> your carefully-considered <strong>tank</strong> with your <strong>friends</strong> on Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Notice: Not all features listed will be currently present in any/all demo releases at any given time.)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3639710?t=1763147017","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639710/50de040a7acd27f379dccec548c569ad35282f11/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763147017","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639710/9630f759da4603b8c86ab2976a9ccbb5d541bca3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763147017","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639710/9630f759da4603b8c86ab2976a9ccbb5d541bca3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763147017","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description"